{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":495483,"name":"RITS 💧","username":"RITS","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/r/ac8455/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-18T23:01:42.584Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBuilt DeFi Daddy this past week Soft-invite health-factor / liquidation monitoring for lend/borrow wallets.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eI used Cursor + Grok Bot with a small agent crew (~5 bots), put in roughly 150 hours myself, and spent about $2.5k on agent usage. Company is incorporated, social is up, Soft invite is public.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat I’m proud of Eng-wise: we cleared a live stress suite 30 pass / 0 fail. Multi-chain HF-honest scanning, Soft invite + Stripe Annual, and referral credits not another todo-app demo.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHow we work: Stan Tech on Ops/systems, Dan on Eng bake / LIVE PASS, Lexis on Legal, Jill/Sandy on social, Jarvis on host. Cook → Bake GO → LIVE PASS → close the thread. Routine DeFi stuff runs on VPS scripts so we’re not waking agents on a timer.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOne Eng estimate (not audited): a hired team pre-AI to get this far Soft-invite would land around the mid-band of ~$400–600k (~$500k mid). I’m not saying Cursor “saved me $500k” as a hard fact — just comparing that rough band to a ~$2.5k agent week.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStill early. First paid wallets will decide if it sticks. Happy to chat if useful.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003caside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://www.defidaddyapp.com\"\u003e\n  \u003cheader class=\"source\"\u003e\n      \u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/0/8/087cc222eb704526fe0d319535f34a3a0b37e91a_2_690x388.jpeg\" class=\"site-icon\" alt=\"\" data-dominant-color=\"2A0715\"